    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Team Earley is delighted to present to the market this charming two-bedroom residence at Ballysundrivan, Elphin, Co. Roscommon.\n\nSet in a peaceful countryside location, this attractive home extends to approximately 1,000 sq. ft. and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property is in solid condition but would benefit from some modernisation, giving the new owner an excellent opportunity to upgrade the home to their own taste. Importantly, the roof has been recently renovated, providing a significant recent improvement to the property.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a bright front porch, welcoming entrance hallway, spacious sitting room, kitchen, two bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nTo the rear is a beautiful mature garden, providing a private and tranquil outdoor space with established planting and plenty of room to relax and enjoy the surrounding countryside.\n\nThe property, formerly known as ?Boherroe Schools? also benefits from an interesting local history which adds to its character without taking away from its appeal as a comfortable country home.\n\nDespite its peaceful setting, the property is very conveniently located, with Elphin approximately 5 minutes away and both Carrick-on-Shannon and Boyle less than 15 minutes away.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a characterful two-bedroom home with mature gardens, good accommodation and further potential in an attractive and accessible rural setting.\n\nServices \n0"
      },
